      "text": "class Maze(Grid)\n# Starts with only walls and slowly gets\nchanged by MazeGen, while validating. Ends as\nvalidated maze. (Validate its structure\naccording to subject criteria of a valid maze.)\n# Machinery representation in our project that\nis easy to interact with\n\n\n\n",
